# detail
Number of changes: 1

1. Modified | Method implementation code block
   Changed the implementation of `url` from formatting `parts` and appending `query` to calling the parent-class `url` method and then constructing the returned string through `url_for(**parts).with_query(query)`.
   The original implementation included:

   * Assignment statement: assign the result of `self._formatter.format_map(parts)` to `url`;
   * Return statement: return `self._append_query(url, query)`.

   The new implementation includes:

   * Expression statement: call `super().url(**parts)`;
   * Return statement: return `str(self.url_for(**parts).with_query(query))`.
# /detail
# mode：Modify method implementation (add superclass call and modify return-call statement)
